          "statement": "Let $D\\in\\mathbb C^{N\\times N}$ be invertible, let $U,V\\in\\mathbb C^{N\\times r}$, and set $W=I_r+V^*D^{-1}U$, where $^*$ denotes conjugate transpose. Then $D+UV^*$ is invertible if and only if $W$ is invertible. When these matrices are invertible,\n$$\n(D+UV^*)^{-1}=D^{-1}-D^{-1}U W^{-1}V^*D^{-1}.\n$$",
