          "dependency_level": 4,
          "statement": "Let $S=\\{s\\}$, $A(s)=\\{a\\}$, $\\gamma=1/2$, with a deterministic self-loop reward $1$, and initialize $V_0(s)=0$. Then $V^*(s)=2$ and $V_m(s)=2(1-2^{-m})$, so\n\n$$ \\|V_m-V^*\\|_\\infty=2^{1-m}=\\gamma^m\\|V_0-V^*\\|_\\infty $$\n\nfor every $m\\ge0$; the general value-iteration error bound is attained at every iteration.",
